     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<div class=\"d2u-exp\"><div class=\"d2u-exp-item\"><h4>Tech & VFX Specialist · Levl Studio</h4><div class=\"d2u-when\">2023 – Present</div><p>Tyqawn plays a pivotal role at Levl Studio, leveraging advanced VFX workflows to enhance film, television, and digital platforms. His contributions are central to the Conspirators TV show on ALLBLK.</p></div><div class=\"d2u-exp-item\"><h4>Founder · Work Official LLC</h4><div class=\"d2u-when\">2015 – Present</div><p>Tyqawn founded Work Official LLC, a forward-thinking media agency dedicated to empowering individuals and businesses in their transition to the digital era through creative services and brand development.</p></div><div class=\"d2u-exp-item\"><h4>Digital Education Advocate · Digi2u.org</h4><div class=\"d2u-when\">2023 – Present</div><p>As an active contributor to Digi2u.org, Tyqawn helps bridge the gap between technology and underserved communities.</p></div></div>"
